Lianet Magrans created KAFKA-16004:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Review new consumer inflight offset commit logic
                 Key: KAFKA-16004
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16004
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
          Components: clients, consumer
            Reporter: Lianet Magrans


New consumer logic for committing offsets handles inflight requests, to validate that no commit requests are sent if a previous one hasn't received a response. Review how that logic is currently applied to both, sync and async commits and validate against the legacy coordinator, who seems to apply it only for async commits.



