We were looking into test failures here: https://confluent-kafka-branch-bui=
lder-system-test-results.s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/system-test-kafka-branc=
h-builder--1702475525--jolshan--kafka-15784--7cad567675/2023-12-13--001./20=
23-12-13=E2=80=93001./report.html.=C2=A0

Here is the first failure in the report:
{code:java}
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
