Jeff Kim created KAFKA-16030:
--------------------------------

             Summary: new group coordinator should check if partition goes offline during load
                 Key: KAFKA-16030
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16030
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Jeff Kim
            Assignee: Jeff Kim


The new coordinator stops loading if the partition goes offline during load. However, the partition is still considered active. Instead, we should throw return NOT_LEADER_OR_FOLLOWER exception during load.



--
