> > > With KIP-939 we need to support the case when the ongoing transaction
> > > needs to be preserved when keepPreparedTxn=3Dtrue.  Bumping epoch wit=
hout
> > > aborting or committing a transaction is tricky because epoch is a sho=
rt
> > > value and it's easy to overflow.  Currently, the overflow case is
> handled
> > > by aborting the ongoing transaction, which would send out transaction
> > > markers with epoch=3DShort.MAX_VALUE to the partition leaders, which
