Luke Chen created KAFKA-16031:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Enabling testApplyDeltaShouldHandleReplicaAssignedToOnlineDirectory for tiered storage after supporting JBOD
                 Key: KAFKA-16031
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16031
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Test
          Components: Tiered-Storage
            Reporter: Luke Chen


Currently, tiered storage doesn't support JBOD (multiple log dirs). The test  testApplyDeltaShouldHandleReplicaAssignedToOnlineDirectory requires multiple log dirs to run it. We should enable it for tiered storage after supporting JBOD in tiered storage.



--
