Subject: [jira] [Resolved] (KAFKA-15158) Add metrics for
 RemoteDeleteRequestsPerSec, RemoteDeleteErrorsPerSec,
 BuildRemoteLogAuxStateRequestsPerSec, BuildRemoteLogAuxStateErrorsPerSec
MIME-Version: 1.0
