Philip Nee created KAFKA-16034:
----------------------------------

             Summary: AsyncKafkaConsumer will get Invalid Request error when trying to rejoin on fenced/unknown member Id
                 Key: KAFKA-16034
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16034
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Philip Nee


The consumer will log invalid request error when joining from fenced/unknown member id because we didn't reset the HeartbeatState and we won't send the needed fields (rebalanceTimeoutMs for example) when joining.



