In fact alterConfig and incrementalAlterConfig have different semantics, =
we should pass all configs when using alterConfig and we can update =
config  incrementally using incrementalAlterConfigs, and is=E2=80=99t =
not worth doing so since alterConfig has been deprecated for a long =
time.

--,
Best,=20
Ziming

