             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: New Feature
          Components: core
            Reporter: Afshin Moazami
            Assignee: Afshin Moazami


Currently, Kafka emits the producer-byte-rate and fetch-bytes-rate for quot=
a calculations. By adding a new signature to the `[quotaMetricTags|https://=
github.com/afshing/kafka/blob/trunk/clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/=
server/quota/ClientQuotaCallback.java#L40]` method to add the individual to=
pic-partitions size as a parameter, we can define metrics based on the topi=
c name and partition id.=C2=A0

To do that, we need both `ProduceRequest` and `FetchResponse` have the `par=
titionSizes` method and it is public.=C2=A0



