To be able to have topic-partition quota, we need to introduce two topic co=
nfiguration for the producer-byte-rate and consumer-byte-rate.=C2=A0

The assumption is that all partitions of the same topic get the same quota,=
 so we define one config per topic.=C2=A0

This configuration should work both with zookeeper and kraft setup.=C2=A0

Also, we should define a default quota value (to be discussed) and potentia=
lly use the same format as user/client default configuration using `<defaul=
t>` as the value.=C2=A0



