    Resolution: Fixed

> Eagerly load Charset for StringSerializer/StringDeserializer
> ------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-16021
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16021
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Improvement
>          Components: clients
>    Affects Versions: 3.6.1
>            Reporter: Stig Rohde D=C3=B8ssing
>            Assignee: Stig Rohde D=C3=B8ssing
>            Priority: Minor
>             Fix For: 3.8.0
>
>
> StringSerializer and StringDeserializer currently use the String construc=
tor and getBytes methods that take the encoding as a String, necessitating =
a Charset lookup every time those methods are called.
> We could save that lookup by performing it once during the serializer con=
figure call instead.



