Our test suite is failing with frequent OOM. Discussion in the mailing list=
 is here: [https://lists.apache.org/thread/d5js0xpsrsvhgjb10mbzo9cwsy8087x4=
]=C2=A0

To find the source of leaks, I ran the :core:test build target with a singl=
e thread (see below on how to do it) and attached a profiler to it. This Ji=
ra tracks the list of action items identified from the analysis.

How to run tests using a single thread:


{code:java}
diff --git a/build.gradle b/build.gradle
index f7abbf4f0b..81df03f1ee 100644
--- a/build.gradle
+++ b/build.gradle
@@ -74,9 +74,8 @@ ext {
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0"--add-opens=3Djava.security.jgss/sun.security.k=
rb5=3DALL-UNNAMED"
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0)- =C2=A0maxTestForks =3D project.hasProperty('maxParal=
lelForks') ? maxParallelForks.toInteger() : Runtime.runtime.availableProces=
sors()
- =C2=A0maxScalacThreads =3D project.hasProperty('maxScalacThreads') ? maxS=
calacThreads.toInteger() :
- =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0Math.min(Runtime.runtime.availableProcessors(), 8)
+ =C2=A0maxTestForks =3D 1
+ =C2=A0maxScalacThreads =3D 1
=C2=A0 =C2=A0userIgnoreFailures =3D project.hasProperty('ignoreFailures') ?=
 ignoreFailures : false=C2=A0 =C2=A0userMaxTestRetries =3D project.hasPrope=
rty('maxTestRetries') ? maxTestRetries.toInteger() : 0
diff --git a/gradle.properties b/gradle.properties
index 4880248cac..ee4b6e3bc1 100644
--- a/gradle.properties
+++ b/gradle.properties
@@ -30,4 +30,4 @@ scalaVersion=3D2.13.12
=C2=A0swaggerVersion=3D2.2.8
=C2=A0task=3Dbuild
=C2=A0org.gradle.jvmargs=3D-Xmx2g -Xss4m -XX:+UseParallelGC
-org.gradle.parallel=3Dtrue
+org.gradle.parallel=3Dfalse {code}



