------------------------------------

             Summary: Upgrade apacheds to 2.0.0.AM27
                 Key: KAFKA-16066
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16066
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Divij Vaidya


We are currently using a very old dependency. Notably, apacheds is only used for testing when we use MiniKdc, hence, there is nothing stopping us from upgrading it.

Notably, apacheds has removed the component org.apache.directory.server:apacheds-protocol-kerberos in favour of using Apache Kerby, hence, we need to make changes in MiniKdc.scala for this upgrade to work correctly.



